1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,883
Gaon mein sabko aata pisvaane paanch kilometre door jaana padta hai.

2
00:00:05,183 --> 00:00:10,249
Rekha, to yahin aata chakki laga lete hain! Poore gaon ka gehun yahin pisega!

3
00:00:10,549 --> 00:00:13,915
Par chakki chalana, bijli ka bill, sab sambhlega?

4
00:00:14,215 --> 00:00:20,285
Chakki machine, motor aur kamra, lagbhag ek lakh. Commercial bijli connection le lenge.

5
00:00:20,585 --> 00:00:26,814
Pisai ke saath, apna pack aata, besan aur masala bhi bechenge. Asli munafa usi mein hai.

6
00:00:27,364 --> 00:00:32,392
Rekha behen, ye 20 kilo gehun hai. Aata mota peesna, roti ke liye!

7
00:00:32,692 --> 00:00:36,183
Bees minute mein taiyaar, Pandey ji. 4 rupaye kilo pisai.

8
00:00:36,483 --> 00:00:40,215
Pisai aur pack aata milakar, roz ₹1,500 se zyada.

9
00:00:40,515 --> 00:00:45,818
Phir multigrain aur baajre ka aata bana. Sheher mein healthy aate ki badi maang hai.

10
00:00:46,118 --> 00:00:48,767
Pisai se kamai! Rekha ki life set!
